OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fmild in the south, with a few spots of
OL,7,Flight rain. A fresher feel is expected
OL,8,Fin the north, with clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Thicker cloud will arrive
OL,10,Ffrom the west later, bringing patchy
OL,11,Fdrizzle, chiefly over western hills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FWarm and humid in the south
OL,14,Fwith cloudy skies, although some
OL,15,Fbrighter spells are possible. A dry
OL,16,Fstart in the north, before heavy rain
OL,17,Fmoves into Northern Ireland and
OL,18,FScotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
